// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P519333464" "Are you ready to send your group to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>release the Item of Power from Rularuu's Cathedral of Pain?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P312180996" "Release the Item of Power from Rularuu's control"
// SendOffString :
"P1807995102" "Good luck! This task requires far more than just brute strength. You'll need to coordinate your efforts to plunder Rularuu's vault.<br><br>Releasing Rularuu's stolen Items of Power requires three steps. First you must defeat the nearby guardians spawned by the Willforge. Once these creatures are dealt with, a protective field around the nearby Polypsionic Resonator--the large black obelisk--will drop, leaving it vulnerable to attack. If all three resonators are destroyed within 35 seconds of each other, the portal to the Cathedral of Pain will open. There you must again battle the spawns of the Willforge. When they are defeated, you can attack the Aspect of Rularuu that guards the treasure you seek."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1553489580" "Release the Item Of Power"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2744248307" "Releasing Rularuu's stolen Items of Power requires three steps. First you must defeat the nearby guardians spawned by the Willforge. Once these creatures are dealt with, a protective field around the nearby Polypsionic Resonator--the large black obelisk--will drop, leaving it vulnerable to attack. If all three resonators are destroyed within 35 seconds of each other, the portal to the Cathedral of Pain will open. There you must again battle the spawns of the Willforge. When they are defeated, you can attack the Aspect of Rularuu that guards the treasure you seek."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2656502654" "Rularuu stores his Items of Power in extra-dimensional vaults he calls his "Cathedrals of Pain." Each Cathedral is shielded by three obelisks called Psionic Resonators, which are in turn protected by horrors spawned from a nearby Will Forge. Only when the Will Forge spawns are defeated can you attack the resonator. Destroy all three at once, and the portal to the Cathedral of Pain will open wide!"

